# 📊 E-Commerce Sales Performance Dashboard | Power BI

> An interactive Power BI dashboard to analyze e-commerce sales, profit, products, platforms, countries, and monthly performance.

## 📌 Project Overview

This project is an **E-Commerce Sales Performance Dashboard** created using **Power BI**.

The dashboard converts raw e-commerce sales data into simple and useful business insights.

It helps users understand:

- 💰 Sales and Profit
- 📈 Profit Margin
- 🛍️ Product Category Performance
- 🌐 Platform Performance
- 🌍 Country-wise Sales
- 🏆 Top Products
- 📅 Monthly Sales & Profit Trends

The main goal of this project is to make business performance **easy to understand through interactive data visualization**.

## 🎯 Business Problem

E-commerce businesses generate a large amount of sales data from different platforms and countries.

It can be difficult to quickly understand:

- Which products generate the most revenue?
- Which platform performs better?
- Which countries generate more sales?
- Which categories contribute most to revenue?
- How are sales and profit changing every month?

This dashboard provides a **single interactive view** to answer these questions.

