## 6️⃣ 📅 Monthly Sales & Profit

A monthly trend chart shows how sales and profit change throughout the year.

This helps identify:

* 📈 High-performing months
* 📉 Low-performing months
* 💰 Revenue trends
* 💵 Profit trends


## 7️⃣ 🌍 Country Performance

The dashboard provides country-level information such as:

