# 🚀 How to Use This Project

### Step 1: Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/ecommerce-sales-dashboard-powerbi.git
```

### Step 2: Open the Project

Open the downloaded project folder.

### Step 3: Open Power BI

Open:

```text
dashboard/E-Commerce_Sales_Dashboard.pbix
```

### Step 4: Refresh Data

Make sure the Excel dataset is available in the `data` folder.

Then open Power BI and click:

**Home → Refresh**


